  "nodes": {
    "ch01-001": {
      "id": "ch01-001",
      "type": "line",
      "text": {
        "chinese": "李贤家里一直没有很多钱。",
        "english": "Lee Hyun's family has never had much money."
      },
      "scene": {
        "backgroundId": "family-room-late",
        "clearCharacters": true
      },
      "nextId": "ch01-002"
    },
    "ch01-002": {
      "id": "ch01-002",
      "type": "line",
      "text": {
        "chinese": "白天，他在加油站工作。晚上，他回家以后，还要照顾奶奶和妹妹。",
        "english": "During the day he works at a gas station. At night, after he comes home, he still has to take care of Grandma and his younger sister."
      },
      "scene": {
        "backgroundId": "gas-station-night",
        "clearCharacters": true
      },
      "nextId": "ch01-003"
    },
    "ch01-003": {
      "id": "ch01-003",
      "type": "line",
      "text": {
        "chinese": "奶奶身体不好，最近常常生病。",
        "english": "Grandma's health is poor, and she has been sick often recently."
      },
      "scene": {
        "backgroundId": "family-room-late",
        "characters": [
          {
            "characterId": "nainai",
            "personaId": "default",
            "spriteId": "nainai-sick",
            "position": "right",
            "xPercent": 65,
            "scale": 0.75,
            "zIndex": 2
          }
        ]
      },
      "nextId": "ch01-004"
    },
    "ch01-004": {
      "id": "ch01-004",
      "type": "line",
      "text": {
        "chinese": "妹妹虽然不说，可是李贤看得出来，她每天都在担心家里的钱。",
        "english": "His sister does not say it, but Lee Hyun can tell she worries about the family's money every day."
      },
      "scene": {
        "characters": [
          {
            "characterId": "lee-hyun-sister",
            "personaId": "default",
            "spriteId": "lee-hyun-sister-worried",
            "position": "left",
            "xPercent": 35,
            "scale": 0.72,
            "zIndex": 2
          }
        ]
      },
      "nextId": "ch01-005"
    },
    "ch01-005": {
      "id": "ch01-005",
      "type": "line",
      "text": {
        "chinese": "李贤自己也很急，可是他不喜欢把\"我很难\"放在脸上。",
        "english": "Lee Hyun is worried too, but he does not like to show how hard things are on his face."
      },
      "scene": {
        "characters": [
          {
            "characterId": "lee-hyun",
            "personaId": "real-world",
            "spriteId": "lee-hyun-real-sitting-exhausted",
            "position": "left",
            "xPercent": 35,
            "scale": 0.82,
            "zIndex": 2
          }
        ]
      },
      "nextId": "ch01-006"
    },
    "ch01-006": {
      "id": "ch01-006",
      "type": "line",
      "text": {
        "chinese": "他还有一个旧游戏账号。那个账号陪了他很久。",
        "english": "He still has an old game account. That account has been with him for a long time."
      },
      "scene": {
        "backgroundId": "account-sale-screen",
        "clearCharacters": true
      },
      "nextId": "ch01-007"
    },
    "ch01-007": {
      "id": "ch01-007",
      "type": "line",
      "text": {
        "chinese": "以前他最难过的时候，他常常打开电脑，看着那个账号，心里会安静一点。",
        "english": "When he was at his lowest, he would often turn on the computer and look at that account, and his heart would quiet a little."
      },
      "nextId": "ch01-008"
    },
    "ch01-008": {
      "id": "ch01-008",
      "type": "choice",
      "prompt": {
        "chinese": "那个旧账号对李贤来说意味着什么？",
        "english": "What does the old account mean to Lee Hyun?"
      },
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "last-hope",
          "kind": "memory",
          "label": {
            "chinese": "是他最后一点希望。",
            "english": "It is his last bit of hope."
          },
          "nextId": "ch01-009"
        },
        {
          "id": "just-a-game",
          "kind": "expressive",
          "label": {
            "chinese": "只是一个游戏，没什么特别的。",
            "english": "Just a game, nothing special."
          },
          "nextId": "ch01-010"
        },
        {
          "id": "waste-of-time",
          "kind": "expressive",
          "label": {
            "chinese": "浪费时间的东西，早该删了。",
            "english": "A waste of time, should have deleted it long ago."
          },
          "nextId": "ch01-010"
        }
      ]
    },
    "ch01-009": {
      "id": "ch01-009",
      "type": "line",
      "text": {
        "chinese": "对。在他心里，那个账号不只是钱，也是他最后一点希望。他一直告诉自己，只要这个账号还在，他就不算什么都没有。",
        "english": "Right. In his heart, that account is not just money; it is his last hope. He has always told himself that as long as this account exists, he has not lost everything."
      },
      "nextId": "ch01-011"
    },
    "ch01-010": {
      "id": "ch01-010",
      "type": "line",
      "text": {
        "chinese": "不完全是这样。那个账号不只是游戏，也不只是钱。它是李贤告诉自己\"我还没有输\"的方式。",
        "english": "Not quite. That account is not just a game, and not just money. It is Lee Hyun's way of telling himself, 'I have not lost yet.'"
      },
      "nextId": "ch01-011"
    },
    "ch01-011": {
      "id": "ch01-011",
      "type": "line",
      "text": {
        "chinese": "可是有一天晚上，奶奶又病了。",
        "english": "But one night, Grandma gets sick again."
      },
      "scene": {
        "backgroundId": "family-room-late",
        "characters": [
          {
            "characterId": "nainai",
            "personaId": "default",
            "spriteId": "nainai-sick",
            "position": "right",
            "xPercent": 65,
            "scale": 0.75,
            "zIndex": 2
          }
        ]
      },
      "nextId": "ch01-012"
    },
    "ch01-012": {
      "id": "ch01-012",
      "type": "line",
      "speaker": {
        "characterId": "lee-hyun-sister",
        "personaId": "default"
      },
      "text": {
        "chinese": "妹妹小声问他：\"明天买药的钱在哪里？\"",
        "english": "His sister whispers to him, 'Where is the money for tomorrow's medicine?'"
      },
      "scene": {
        "characters": [
          {
            "characterId": "lee-hyun-sister",
            "personaId": "default",
            "spriteId": "lee-hyun-sister-worried",
            "position": "left",
            "xPercent": 35,
            "scale": 0.72,
            "zIndex": 2
          }
        ]
      },
      "nextId": "ch01-013"
    },
    "ch01-013": {
      "id": "ch01-013",
      "type": "line",
      "text": {
        "chinese": "李贤没有马上回答。他看着桌子上的卡，又看着房间里的奶奶，心里很乱。",
        "english": "Lee Hyun does not answer right away. He looks at the card on the table, then at Grandma in the other room. His heart is in turmoil."
      },
      "scene": {
        "characters": [
          {
            "characterId": "lee-hyun",
            "personaId": "real-world",
            "spriteId": "lee-hyun-real-sitting-exhausted",
            "position": "left",
            "xPercent": 35,
            "scale": 0.82,
            "zIndex": 2
          }
        ]
      },
      "nextId": "ch01-014"
    },
    "ch01-014": {
      "id": "ch01-014",
      "type": "line",
      "text": {
        "chinese": "一个声音说：\"不能卖。卖了以后，你就真的什么都没有了。\"",
        "english": "One voice says, 'You cannot sell it. After you sell it, you will truly have nothing.'"
      },
      "nextId": "ch01-015"
    },
    "ch01-015": {
      "id": "ch01-015",
      "type": "line",
      "text": {
        "chinese": "另一个声音说：\"如果不卖，家里怎么办？\"",
        "english": "Another voice says, 'If you do not sell, what will happen to the family?'"
      },
      "nextId": "ch01-016"
    },
    "ch01-016": {
      "id": "ch01-016",
      "type": "line",
      "text": {
        "chinese": "他坐了很久，才慢慢明白，自己一直舍不得的不是游戏本身，而是那个\"我还没有输\"的感觉。",
        "english": "He sits for a long time before slowly understanding: what he has been reluctant to let go of is not the game itself, but the feeling of 'I have not lost yet.'"
      },
      "nextId": "ch01-017"
    },
    "ch01-017": {
      "id": "ch01-017",
      "type": "line",
      "text": {
        "chinese": "第二天，他去把旧账号卖了，把钱带回家。",
        "english": "The next day, he sells the old account and brings the money home."
      },
      "scene": {
        "backgroundId": "account-sale-screen",
        "clearCharacters": true
      },
      "nextId": "ch01-018"
    },
    "ch01-018": {
      "id": "ch01-018",
      "type": "line",
      "text": {
        "chinese": "奶奶先愣了一下，然后轻轻笑了。",
        "english": "Grandma is stunned for a moment, then smiles gently."
      },
      "scene": {
        "backgroundId": "family-room-late",
        "characters": [
          {
            "characterId": "nainai",
            "personaId": "default",
            "spriteId": "nainai-gentle-smile",
            "position": "right",
            "xPercent": 65,
            "scale": 0.75,
            "zIndex": 2
          }
        ]
      },
      "nextId": "ch01-019"
    },
    "ch01-019": {
      "id": "ch01-019",
      "type": "line",
      "text": {
        "chinese": "妹妹也终于松了一口气。",
        "english": "His sister finally breathes a sigh of relief."
      },
      "scene": {
        "characters": [
          {
            "characterId": "lee-hyun-sister",
            "personaId": "default",
            "spriteId": "lee-hyun-sister-relieved",
            "position": "left",
            "xPercent": 35,
            "scale": 0.72,
            "zIndex": 2
          }
        ]
      },
      "nextId": "ch01-020"
    },
    "ch01-020": {
      "id": "ch01-020",
      "type": "line",
      "text": {
        "chinese": "李贤心里还是有点空，可是那种空没有让他更怕。相反，他第一次觉得自己更稳了。",
        "english": "Lee Hyun's heart still feels a little empty, but that emptiness does not scare him more. On the contrary, for the first time he feels more steady."
      },
      "scene": {
        "characters": [
          {
            "characterId": "lee-hyun",
            "personaId": "real-world",
            "spriteId": "lee-hyun-real-forced-smile",
            "position": "left",
            "xPercent": 35,
            "scale": 0.82,
            "zIndex": 2
          }
        ]
      },
      "nextId": "ch01-021"
    },
    "ch01-021": {
      "id": "ch01-021",
      "type": "line",
      "text": {
        "chinese": "他知道，真正让人安心的，不是手里留着什么东西，而是自己愿意为了家里去做对的事。",
        "english": "He knows that what truly brings peace is not holding on to things, but being willing to do the right thing for your family."
      },
      "nextId": "ch01-result"
    },
    "ch01-result": {
      "id": "ch01-result",
      "type": "questResult",
      "questId": "ch01-sell-account",
      "outcomeId": "sold-account",
      "completed": true,
      "resultId": "ch01-sold-account",
      "summary": {
        "chinese": "李贤卖掉了旧游戏账号，换来奶奶的药费。他失去了一样东西，却找到了更稳的自己。",
        "english": "Lee Hyun sold his old game account to pay for Grandma's medicine. He lost something, but found a steadier version of himself."
      },
      "worldEffects": [
        {
          "id": "sold-account-flag",
          "op": "setFlag",
          "key": "sold-account",
          "value": true
        }
      ],
      "returnLocationId": "real-world-apartment"
    }
  }
}
